{"schema_version":1,"meta":{"template_type":"refactor","name":"代码重构","summary":"代码重构/瘦身，行为不变前提下降低复杂度、清理死代码、提升可读性，保证性能不退化。","scenarios":["代码重构","代码瘦身","简化","清理死代码","降低复杂度"],"features":["Code Review 配置","Verification Contract","行为不变判据","Phases","隔离决策"],"lineage":{"level":"derived","parent":"../task_plan.md","base":"../task_plan.md","spec_version":1,"pruned":["用户需求原文","根源覆盖表","不变量声明区","规范基线","进度产出基线","双轮质检与同步完整性声明","核心目标达成裁决","变更标注表","核心问题定义","调研需求与检索计划","证据面清单","NextStep","防倒退终检","收尾回读梳理记录","收尾对齐与清理","FMEA预演","Chain区块交接配置"],"pruned_reason":"variant=领域裁剪全文，裁剪面以本清单显式登记（Rule 34.5 派生登记）"}},"sections":[{"id":"sec-goal","anchor":"## Goal","level":2,"kind":"ref","ref":{"path":"goals","renderer":"goal_statement"},"required":true},{"id":"sec-code-review","anchor":"## 🔍 Code Review 配置","level":2,"kind":"ref","ref":{"path":"config","renderer":"code_review_table"},"required":true},{"id":"sec-vc","anchor":"## ✅ Verification Contract","level":2,"kind":"ref","ref":{"path":"vcs","renderer":"vc_table"},"required":true},{"id":"sec-scope-limits","anchor":"## ⚠️ 执行范围限制","level":2,"kind":"ref","ref":{"path":"scope_limits","renderer":"scope_limits_table"},"required":true},{"id":"sec-knowledge","anchor":"## 📚 必要知识储备（任务知识库对齐 — 开工前必填）","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"note","kind":"markdown","text":"> 目的：对齐任务知识库。列出本任务依赖的规范/文档/文献/图书等知识源，Phase 1 开工前逐项确认可获取；`必读` 项无法获取 → STOP 记入 findings.md Errors，禁止凭记忆硬写。"},{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["类别","名称/主题","定位（路径/URL/版本/commit SHA）","必读级别","已确认"],"rows":[["规范/标准","","","必读/参考","☐"],["官方文档","","","必读/参考","☐"],["项目内部文档/知识库","","","参考","☐"],["文献/论文","","","参考","☐"],["图书/教程","","","参考","☐"],["重构方法论","如《重构》Martin Fowler / 团队代码规范","书目/路径","参考","☐"]]},{"id":"note-2","kind":"markdown","text":"**填写规则**：① `定位` 必须可唯一定位（绝对路径/URL+版本）；② `必读` 项缺失 → 停止执行并在 Errors Encountered 登记；③ 引用格式对齐 SKILL.md「调研类操作·强制引用格式」。\n- **调研需求三态（Rule 75.1）**：本模板任务默认**可选**——重构基于既有代码内部结构调整、行为不变前提，通常依赖项目内部证据；仅当涉及陌生框架/库用法检索或外部重构设计模式时升级 NET-RESEARCH；需调研时调研 Phase 必须登记检索关键词+渠道+预期产出到计划「🔍 调研需求与检索计划」区块"},{"id":"checks","kind":"checklist","items":[{"id":"KN-规范标准已确","text":"规范/标准 · 已确认","checked":false,"note":""},{"id":"KN-官方文档已确","text":"官方文档 · 已确认","checked":false,"note":""},{"id":"KN-项目内部文档","text":"项目内部文档/知识库 · 已确认","checked":false,"note":""},{"id":"KN-文献论文已确","text":"文献/论文 · 已确认","checked":false,"note":""},{"id":"KN-图书教程已确","text":"图书/教程 · 已确认","checked":false,"note":""},{"id":"KN-重构方法论已","text":"重构方法论 · 已确认","checked":false,"note":""}]}]},{"id":"sec-current-phase","anchor":"## Current Phase","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"note","kind":"markdown","text":"Phase 1"}]},{"id":"sec-tool-selection","anchor":"## 🧰 工具选择与编排（Rule 40 — 计划期主动分析）","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"note","kind":"markdown","text":"逐 Phase 登记工具面与理由;Executor 字段仍是委派门控机器事实源;mini 豁免"},{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["Phase","命中工具面","选择理由"],"rows":[["Phase 1","[如: Agent 子代理 executor(sonnet-1)]","[一句话理由]"]]}]},{"id":"sec-phases","anchor":"## Phases","level":2,"kind":"ref","ref":{"path":"phases","renderer":"phases_table"},"required":true},{"id":"sec-isolation-decision","anchor":"## 🔀 隔离决策","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["字段","值"],"rows":[["`conflict_scan`","`safe` / `risk`"],["`isolation`","`worktree`(默认)"],["`worktree_path`","`<project-root>/tmp/worktrees/<task-id>`(Rule 100:临时产物统一当前项目 tmp/,tmp/ 入 .gitignore)"],["`branch`","`wt/<task-id>`"],["`merge_back`","`pending` → `merged(<commit>)`"]]}]},{"id":"sec-todo-sync","anchor":"## 🔁 原生 Todo 同步","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["Phase","Todo 已建","最近同步时间","备注"],"rows":[["Phase 1","☐","","前置分析"],["Phase 2","☐","","方案设计"],["Phase 3","☐","","实施"],["Phase 4","☐","","验证"],["Phase 5","☐","","Review + commit"]]},{"id":"checks","kind":"checklist","items":[{"id":"TD-PHASE-TODO","text":"Phase 1 · Todo 已建","checked":false,"note":""},{"id":"TD-PHASE-TODO-